    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">内容</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Melona:_The_Protean_Assassin\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">梅罗娜：千变万化的刺客</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Strategy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">策略</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Vs._Melona\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">对梅罗娜</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Overall_Judgement\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">总体评价</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Melona:_The_Protean_Assassin\">梅罗娜：千变万化的刺客</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMelona_Guide%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/c/c8/Melona_GB.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20130523032646\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Melona GB\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/c/c8/Melona_GB.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20130523032646\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"254\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Melona GB.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Melona_GB.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Melona_GB.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<ul><li>BP：7</li>\n<li>身高：4</li>\n<li>攻击：1</li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/Melona\" title=\"Melona\">梅罗娜</a>  她是《女皇之刃》系列书中较有趣且充满活力的角色之一，赋予她复杂的性格和陡峭的学习曲线需要掌握。尽管如此，她是少数能将生命值提升远超初始值的《女皇之刃》角色之一，几乎以极快的速度增长，若不在早期加以压制，将构成巨大威胁。\n\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Strategy\">策略</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMelona_Guide%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/4/40/I029.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20130523050054\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"I029\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/4/40/I029.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20130523050054\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"244\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"I029.jpg\" data-image-key=\"I029.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:I029.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>梅罗娜的初始BP小得令人痛苦，甚至如果第1回合就被命中她的某张分数页，可能会直接被打倒！然而她却有一个有趣的特性——她的治疗量没有上限。因此很明显，作为梅罗娜玩家，你开局的首要策略应该是先给自己堆出一个远超对手的巨大血量池，然后再开始施加压力。幸运的是，她的动作与这一策略配合得天衣无缝，因为她的远距离和近距离闪避都能恢复BP(分别+2和+1)，蹲下也能(+2)，向后跳(两种距离均+1)，还有她的特殊动作\"聚拢\"(惊人的+4！)。\n\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/4/40/Melona_7.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20130523050916\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Melona 7\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/4/40/Melona_7.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20130523050916\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"241\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Melona 7.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Melona_7.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Melona_7.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p><br />\n\n梅罗娜能够治疗，而且在极短的时间内大量治疗，甚至可能在短时间内将起始BP翻倍不止！但这也正是梅罗娜的复杂之处——她的许多攻击反过来要消耗BP。消耗1点BP，她的\"盾牌格挡\"技能就能拉大你与对手伤害输出之间的距离，使对方武器MOD降低1点。而梅罗娜的\"喷泥\"攻击，虽然会消耗你2点BP，却确保她总能造成伤害，即使被格挡也不例外！这些手段让她能够削弱那些拥有+3和+4 MOD的高伤害书页，确保自己不会被一击必杀，并降低受到暴击的概率(库罗德特就是最典型的例子)，同时也能让她面对那些伤害分数页极低的角色时(米莉姆……就是……米莉姆啊……)拥有应对之法。\n\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/3/31/I024.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20130523045733\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"I024\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"242\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"I024.jpg\" data-image-key=\"I024.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/3/31/I024.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20130523045733\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/3/31/I024.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20130523045733\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"I024\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/3/31/I024.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20130523045733\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"242\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"I024.jpg\" data-image-key=\"I024.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/3/31/I024.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20130523045733\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:I024.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>尽管梅罗娜的招牌是BP增减，但她的工具包却极为全面。她拥有完整的「挥砍」「突刺」和「佯攻」(即她的剑击)，能够打出一套非常扎实的「混合」战术，但由于这些招式互相禁用，缺乏突刺(突刺禁用挥砍，而佯攻和挥砍禁用突刺)就会露出破绽，让对手「跳开」。在这种情况下，她的「史莱姆投射：抛掷物体」能打对手个措手不及，代价是损失BP。梅罗娜的「盾牌与武器」攻击给了她更安全的接近激进攻击者的手段，而她的龙踢则拥有游戏中最强攻击之一(而且加5！)。她还能使用锤子技能破坏对手的盾牌和武器，因此几乎可以对抗任何持有这些装备的敌人。\n\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Vs._Melona\">对梅罗娜</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMelona_Guide%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/6/64/Melona_6.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20130523045528\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Melona 6\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"246\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Melona 6.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Melona_6.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/6/64/Melona_6.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20130523045528\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/6/64/Melona_6.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20130523045528\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Melona 6\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/6/64/Melona_6.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20130523045528\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"246\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Melona 6.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Melona_6.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/6/64/Melona_6.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20130523045528\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Melona_6.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>畏惧一位熟练的梅罗娜是合理的，因为她几乎能不停治疗，几乎对游戏中所有情况都有应对选项，但她绝非直接过强。梅罗娜的SCORE面板极高，导致单次被打中的伤害会痛很久，而她自身的BP消耗也让她几乎和恢复速度一样快地掉血！此外，梅罗娜最怕的就是造成「直接伤害」的施法者，因为她没有任何削减或降低攻击的手段，只能寄望于过量治疗并听天由命。由于她的机制，她也会比直接进攻更多地使用「跳跃」选项，只要好好读她的意图，就能轻松将她压制。最后，一个小讽刺是，打掉她的武器会使她的BP减少1，但绝不会以任何方式让她瘫痪。\n\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Overall_Judgement\">总体评价</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMelona_Guide%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/3/3e/2P_MELONA.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20130523033238\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"2P MELONA\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"253\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"2P MELONA.jpg\" data-image-key=\"2P_MELONA.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/3/3e/2P_MELONA.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20130523033238\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/3/3e/2P_MELONA.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20130523033238\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"2P MELONA\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/3/3e/2P_MELONA.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20130523033238\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"253\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"2P MELONA.jpg\" data-image-key=\"2P_MELONA.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/3/3e/2P_MELONA.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20130523033238\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:2P_MELONA.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>在女皇之刃系列中，梅罗娜相当偏离常规的构筑。她拥有应对任何战斗的工具(盾牌、招架和重击手)，再加上没有上限的特殊机制，她是最强的选择之一。不过，她需要熟练的操作，因为她的初始BP让她容易在1到2回合内被击败，更不用说她的许多攻击都会消耗BP。那些非常熟悉女皇之刃战斗节奏的玩家会发现她非常有趣，能根据对手调整策略。但其他玩家可能会觉得她的复杂度难以接受，反而难以操控。\n\n</p>\n<ul><li><b>技能等级：高级/专家</b></li>\n<li><b>等级：A  </b></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260820063606\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.015 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.022 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 17/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_queensblade:pcache:idhash:27181-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260820063606 and revision id 63229. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"
}